Package: GausSKAT
Type: Package
Title: Data-Adaptive Weighted Gaussian-Kernel SKAT
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Puneet", "Kalra", role = "aut"),
    person("Suresh Kumar", "Sharma", email = "ssharma@pu.ac.in",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Implements GausSKAT for continuous traits. The method constructs a
    phenotype-independent, data-adaptive grid of weighted Gaussian kernels,
    evaluates each kernel with the sequence kernel association test, and
    combines the dependent component p-values using the aggregated Cauchy
    association test. Functions for reproducible power simulations are also
    provided.
License: GPL (>= 2)
